  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 03/12/2024, the use of The Falcon School for Boys, 2 Burnaby Gardens, W4 3DT as shown on drawing numbers CWK001-001,  CWK001-002,  CWK001-051 P2,  CWK001-050 P2,  CWK001-052 P2, CWK001-053 P2,  CWK001-049 P2,  CWK001-101, CWK001-100, CWK001-102,  CWK001-103,  CWK001-099, planning statement, LinkedIn extract, Statutory declaration, Statutory declaration submitted on 03/12/2024 would not be lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\nThe proposal would constitute development as per the meaning of development within Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) as it would result in a material change of use requiring the express grant of planning permission from the local planning authority before it could take place.\r\n"
